  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added SpatialHexPartitionMap and SpatialPartialHexPartitionMap, geometry-preserving SplitDisconnectedCells and Cellular Potts extensions, covariant IHexMap, and configurable outward polyhex region offsets via ToOffsetRegion. Breaking changes: full Voronoi partitions now return SpatialHexPartitionMap<VoronoiHexPartitionCell>; Perlin partitions now return SpatialHexPartitionMap<HexPartitionCell> or SpatialPartialHexPartitionMap<HexPartitionCell>. Removed VoronoiHexPartitionMap, PerlinNoiseHexPartitionMap, and PartialPerlinNoiseHexPartitionMap. Rebuild consumers and migrate explicit result types and removed full-Voronoi convenience members. Targets remain netstandard2.1 and net6.0; the minimum Spatial2D dependency remains 1.1.0.",
